load @term/seed/code/structure/space/vector
  find vector-space

# A vector: an element of a vector space, an arrow with magnitude and direction that adds to other vectors and scales by
# the field. Vectors are the things that live in space, and the deepest demand of the theory is that they are the same
# substance as the directions of space itself, a coincidence that holds only in dimension eight. The form carries the
# vector space the vector belongs to.
form vector
  link space, like vector-space
